From b11458e49b8d3cac4b920b119169e34e4e8e1d80 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gliniak <153369+Gliniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 20:23:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [XContent] Allow loading of content directly from packages.

Currently NOT supported for savefiles and profiles.

Added separation of XContent header from Device.
Now XContent Package is responsible for device setup.
Device moved to memory mapped data without access to XContent specific data.

Moved most of stfs_xbox.h from VFS to XContent
